  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Finance Facility to Improve Air Quality and Combat Climate Change in North Macedonia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">North Macedonia is advancing towards a low-emission sustainable development pathway via the utilization of renewable energy and energy-efficient solutions, benefiting both women and men and vulnerable groups. If access to a financial facility, finance and incentives are improved, then this will trigger prioritization of investments into renewable energy and energy efficiency solutions that will contribute improved air quality, reduced CO2 emissions, and sustained socio-economic growth.</narrative>
  </description>
